      "writtenOn": "2026-02-05T19:24:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wondering if the same thing should be done here (though it isn\u0027t quite as obvious how since the collection may not be directly available). In theory making a clone (any change of axis poisition) can also change the reported family name. I\u0027ve made a separate change so the PostScript name should only depend on the IDWriteFontFace (instead of the IDWriteFont), but the family name is still sticky after a clone.",
      "revId": "d7590b19effa368173b8b37c2c48d1f60f79a7a5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
