      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-05T19:47:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the moment there doesn\u0027t need to be any change here, mostly just wanted to point out the weird bit of how the DirectWrite API is structured, which originally made it difficult to get \"family\" information out of just a FontFace (the \"real thing\") and slowly started to need over time to push all the \"higher level group property getters\" down to the FontFace anyway.",
      "parentUuid": "7fd6b315_f645d3df",
      "revId": "d7590b19effa368173b8b37c2c48d1f60f79a7a5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
