        "id": 3924380
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-06T06:05:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing this out, I agree on weird bit of DWrite API structuring.\n\nI also checked `DWriteFontTypeface::onMakeClone()`, which is used in web variable font, and postscript name is not correct it seems.",
      "parentUuid": "7103cadc_303b2103",
      "revId": "d7590b19effa368173b8b37c2c48d1f60f79a7a5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ea9eab74_966c948b",
        "filename": "src/ports/SkTypeface_win_dw.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1190,
